.TH WERKMEISTER-ISSUE-START 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-issue\-start \- Move the workspace's issue (or \e<ref>) to in progress and fast\-forward its worktrees
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister issue start\fR [ref]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-attach\fR
Record \e<ref> as the workspace's issue in .werkmeister/workspace.yml (no init rerun, stages/ untouched)
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
